         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Bact conjunctivitis: drops - trimethoprim-polymyxin B (or azithro) - ointments - erythromycin · sulfacetamide · bacitracin-polymyxin B"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
