         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Contact lens wearer: ↑risk of sight-threatening Pseudomonas keratitis - erythromycin ointment + topical sulfacetamide lack pseudomonal coverage → use a fluoroquinolone drop (eg moxifloxacin)"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
