          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Corneal abrasion: ointments preferred over drops (lubricate & protect) - trimethoprim-polymyxin B acceptable if ⍉contacts - ⍉topical steroids (prednisolone: impair healing · ↑2ndry infect)"
